+/**
+ * The median of an array of numbers: the middle value once sorted, or the mean of the two middle
+ * values when the length is even. The array is not modified.
+ * @param {number[]} xs
+ * @returns {number} The median; NaN for an empty array or one that contains NaN.
+ * @throws {TypeError} If xs is not an array, or it contains a value that is not a number.
+ */
